  ($q$ii-645$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Information and Ideas$q$, $q$Command of Evidence (Textual)$q$, 2, $q$A researcher claims that sleep-deprived students make more errors. The study states: 'On the attention task, students who slept under five hours made an average of 14 errors, compared with 6 errors among students who slept eight hours.'$q$, $q$Which finding best supports the researcher's claim?$q$, $q$["The study took place in spring.","The task lasted twenty minutes.","Students who slept under five hours averaged 14 errors, compared with 6 errors for students who slept eight hours.","The students were in tenth grade."]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The error counts compare sleep groups directly.$q$, null),
