  ($q$cs-61$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 1, $q$The restorer said the antique book's binding was surprisingly ______, still holding every page firmly in place after two centuries of handling.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["durable","fragile","loose","damaged"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$A binding that still holds every page firmly in place after two centuries of handling is durable, not fragile, loose, or damaged.$q$, null),
