  ($q$cs-67$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 2, $q$The climate dataset was considered ______ by the review board, since three independent research teams had reached the identical conclusion using different methods.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["robust","flawed","preliminary","contested"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Three independent teams reaching the same conclusion through different methods is a hallmark of a robust, well-supported dataset.$q$, null),
