  ($q$pd-512$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$q$, $q$Rates and units$q$, 1, null, $q$A train travels at a constant speed of 90 miles per hour. How many miles does it travel in 60 minutes?$q$, $q$["5400","150","90","540"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$60 minutes is 60/60 = 1 hour. Distance = 90 × 1 = 90 miles.$q$, null),
