  ($q$pd-699$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$q$, $q$Rates and units$q$, 2, null, $q$A metal sample has a density of 8 grams per cubic centimeter and a mass of 48 grams. What is the volume, in cubic centimeters, of the sample?$q$, $q$["56","8","6","384"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$Density = mass/volume, so volume = mass/density = 48/8 = 6 cubic centimeters.$q$, null),
