  ($q$geo-680$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Lines and angles$q$, 2, null, $q$Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. A pair of same-side interior angles measure (3x − 4)° and (5x + 104)°. What is the value of x?$q$, $q$["11","−54","10","26"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$Same-side interior angles are supplementary: (3x − 4) + (5x + 104) = 180, so 8x + 100 = 180 and x = 10.$q$, null),
