  ($q$geo-723$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Lines and angles$q$, 2, null, $q$Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. A pair of same-side interior angles measure (4x − 1)° and (5x − 35)°. What is the value of x?$q$, $q$["34","95","25","24"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$Same-side interior angles are supplementary: (4x − 1) + (5x − 35) = 180, so 9x − 36 = 180 and x = 24.$q$, null),
